    "created_at": "2016-10-14T02:35:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-14T02:35:32Z",
    "body": "> note that allocating a promise is cheaper than an empty array at this point \n\nNot all runtimes are created equal. Netflix has to deal with exotic runtimes and older browsers where this isn't true. And hardware isn't always great, or is sometimes busy.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
