    "created_at": "2016-10-17T06:03:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-17T06:03:23Z",
    "body": "@benjamingr the problem with async-iterators is that promise-based timing is not compatible with event dispatch. E.g., if you want to use `preventDefault()` (or `respondWith()` in service workers) you need to be able to do that \"synchronously\" and not in a microtask later on.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
