    "body": "@benjamingr because the code looks like:\n\n``` js\nvar doSomething = obj.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"test\", {cancelable:true})\nif(doSomething)\n  // ...\n```\n\nSo if `preventDefault()` is not invoked during dispatch, `if(doSomething)` will go down the wrong branch.\n",
