    "updated_at": "2017-02-01T23:09:27Z",
    "body": "[Here's why I find this proposal not as great as it might seem](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-observable/issues/129). It may seem nice at first, but the allocations would make it a performance nightmare, especially on highly spammy events like `\"mousemove\"`.",
